  "keyFeatures": [
    "Event creation with exclusive public event page",
    "Online registration and ticket sales (Pix, credit card, bank slip)",
    "Multi-tier pricing with automatic batch (lote) transitions",
    "Discount coupons (fixed value, percentage, complimentary)",
    "Real-time sales dashboard and financial reporting",
    "Mobile check-in app with QR code scanning",
    "Custom registration forms with medical record support",
    "White-label event pages for brand customization",
    "Sports agency (assessoria) bulk purchase support",
    "Automatic confirmation emails to participants",
    "CPF-unique inscription control to prevent duplicates",
    "Support for 20+ sports modalities"
